WEBVTT

00:18.650 --> 00:18.690
Movers

00:18.690 --> 00:18.730
Zakku

00:49.460 --> 00:50.600
Wanna go do something?

01:17.670 --> 01:20.830
Hey, miss, where do you want me to put this?

01:20.830 --> 01:22.340
Bring that upstairs, please!

01:22.300 --> 01:24.300
Mitsuhashi

01:22.340 --> 01:24.340
Mum! Mum!

01:24.560 --> 01:26.210
What now?

01:26.210 --> 01:27.890
I'm gonna go get a haircut.

01:27.890 --> 01:29.290
Gimme some money.

01:29.290 --> 01:31.530
My purse is by the front door.

01:31.850 --> 01:34.730
Don't be long! You still have to help unpack all our stuff!

01:34.730 --> 01:35.450
Okay.

01:38.410 --> 01:39.930
Take 3,000 yen.

01:39.930 --> 01:41.500
And no more than that!

01:41.890 --> 01:43.850
O-Okay, I hear ya.

01:47.330 --> 01:49.850
There's no way three grand'd be enough.

01:49.850 --> 01:52.050
Once I go to my new school,

01:52.050 --> 01:54.050
my new life will begin.

01:54.050 --> 01:55.520
Yeah.

01:55.210 --> 02:00.210
Starting  today,  I'll!!

01:55.210 --> 02:00.210
Presented by Saizen-Yabai

01:55.520 --> 01:57.530
Starting today, I'll...

02:11.780 --> 02:11.820
Haircuts & Perms

02:15.400 --> 02:18.370
Hair Salon

02:16.010 --> 02:18.620
Maybe that one's better...

02:24.170 --> 02:25.920
Who does this...

02:25.920 --> 02:28.080
...jackass think he is?

02:38.050 --> 02:39.770
How would you like it?

02:39.770 --> 02:42.730
P-P-P-P-Pe—

02:45.810 --> 02:48.480
I want it dyed blond and permed, please.

02:49.570 --> 02:53.150
I said I want it dyed blond and permed! You hear me?!

02:53.150 --> 02:54.650
S-Sure...

03:08.010 --> 03:09.830
Wh-What do you think?

03:14.130 --> 03:15.690
This'll make an impression.

03:15.690 --> 03:19.010
From this day forward, my life will be full of surprises!

03:20.690 --> 03:22.570
Are you sure this is okay?

03:22.570 --> 03:24.370
You're a high school student, aren't you?

03:24.370 --> 03:28.140
It's fine. There are lots of blonds in other countries.

03:30.170 --> 03:31.570
With this haircut, starting today, I'll—

03:31.570 --> 03:33.410
Thank you. Please come again.

03:40.450 --> 03:42.730
This bozo looks like a sea urchin...

03:42.730 --> 03:45.650
Wh-What's up with this blond douchebag?

03:47.730 --> 03:50.250
Starting today, you're a
self-styled bad boy, huh?

03:53.880 --> 03:55.840
Self-Styled
Bad
Boy

03:56.730 --> 04:00.730
The self-declared bad boy is different from your normal breed of rebels...

04:00.730 --> 04:07.130
and is defined as a guy who suddenly decides he wants to act like a delinquent.

04:12.170 --> 04:13.250
Wow...

04:13.250 --> 04:14.290
He's blond!

04:14.290 --> 04:15.690
Who <i>is</i> that?

04:15.690 --> 04:17.110
He's so out there...

04:17.110 --> 04:20.330
As I mentioned before, starting today, we are welcoming a new classmate.

04:21.210 --> 04:22.650
This is Mitsuhashi Takashi.

04:22.130 --> 04:24.050
<i>Here we go...</i>

04:22.650 --> 04:24.050
Please welcome him to our class.

04:24.050 --> 04:25.650
Mitsuhashi!

04:27.090 --> 04:30.750
Well, there are a lot of boys like you in this class.

04:30.750 --> 04:32.250
I'm sure you'll get along here just fine.

04:32.250 --> 04:33.410
Right!

04:35.330 --> 04:37.570
Itou, you're late.

04:39.810 --> 04:42.010
Here's our other new student.

04:42.010 --> 04:43.570
This is Itou.

04:43.570 --> 04:44.610
Yo.

04:48.250 --> 04:49.290
It's you!

04:51.850 --> 04:53.980
Oh, I see you two already know each other.

04:54.450 --> 04:57.730
I don't know this dweeb. I just bumped
into him yesterday outside the—

04:57.730 --> 05:00.970
M-M-Mind your own business!

05:01.770 --> 05:02.930
What was that, urchin-head?

05:02.930 --> 05:05.970
You want me to turn you into sushi?!

05:05.970 --> 05:08.490
Did someone take a piss on your head?

05:08.490 --> 05:10.250
You picking a fight?!

05:12.410 --> 05:14.210
Y-You bastard!

05:14.210 --> 05:15.610
You wanna go?!

05:15.610 --> 05:17.330
Bring it!

05:17.330 --> 05:19.920
Hey! Stop it! Both of you!

05:20.890 --> 05:23.900
You can't get away with fighting on your first day of school!

05:24.210 --> 05:26.350
I said stop it, you little thugs!

05:27.730 --> 05:28.970
Thugs?

05:28.970 --> 05:29.810
Us?

05:30.290 --> 05:32.010
N-No, I mean...

05:32.010 --> 05:33.730
It was just a f-figure of speech.

05:35.890 --> 05:38.570
As this is our first day, maybe we should just sit down...

05:38.570 --> 05:41.090
...and listen to our teacher.

05:53.090 --> 05:55.690
More troublemakers have joined my class...

06:06.570 --> 06:10.690
And to think, that loser's a transfer student too...

06:19.930 --> 06:20.570
Hey there, listen.

06:20.570 --> 06:21.320
Y-Yes?

06:21.730 --> 06:24.820
Why are there so few people in this class?

06:24.820 --> 06:27.370
That's, uh... That's because...

06:27.370 --> 06:28.850
Hey...

06:30.650 --> 06:32.080
Howdy all!

06:33.330 --> 06:34.570
B-Because of those guys?

06:36.690 --> 06:38.010
I see.

06:46.050 --> 06:49.290
Aw hell no, this ain't good.

06:49.290 --> 06:51.050
They're gonna smash me to pieces.

06:53.020 --> 06:55.730
Come with us for a few minutes.

06:59.850 --> 07:01.210
Okay.

07:07.050 --> 07:10.250
You're attracting a lot of attention for a transfer student, aren't ya?

07:11.570 --> 07:12.210
Why, thank you.

07:13.290 --> 07:16.650
If you keep that attitude up, you're in for a whole world of pain.

07:16.650 --> 07:18.090
Huh? What's that?

07:18.090 --> 07:20.370
You think the two of you can take me down all by yourselves?

07:22.690 --> 07:23.810
That was so badass!

07:23.810 --> 07:25.510
That had to impress them!

07:25.510 --> 07:25.510
Right?

07:26.210 --> 07:27.850
D-Don't get ahead of yourself.

07:32.970 --> 07:34.610
Five of them?

07:34.610 --> 07:37.130
Mitsuhashi, is it?

07:37.130 --> 07:40.650
Yeah, that's the arrogant, yellow-topped pretty boy.

07:40.650 --> 07:42.610
Who the hell do you think you are?

07:43.250 --> 07:44.570
This looks bad...

07:44.570 --> 07:48.330
My daily workout on my Pro Worker isn't gonna help with this lot.

07:48.330 --> 07:49.450
Wait!

07:55.930 --> 07:58.570
Five against one is fighting dirty.

08:00.450 --> 08:01.770
What the hell do you think <i>you're</i> doing?

08:01.770 --> 08:03.410
Giving you a hand.

08:03.410 --> 08:04.610
Huh?

08:04.610 --> 08:07.930
Looks like Nanyou's full of pussies.

08:07.930 --> 08:08.880
What?!

08:08.880 --> 08:13.010
I can't stand it when people pick on weaklings.

08:13.010 --> 08:13.850
What did you call me?!

08:14.170 --> 08:16.010
Come on, you chicken-shits, bring it!

08:16.010 --> 08:17.850
Who the hell are you calling a weakling?!

08:17.850 --> 08:19.010
What's wrong?

08:18.290 --> 08:19.770
Hey!

08:19.010 --> 08:21.210
You ready for a fight or what?

08:19.770 --> 08:21.210
Hey, Itou!

08:21.210 --> 08:22.690
Hey, listen to me when I'm talking to you!

08:23.970 --> 08:25.730
What the hell are you doing, you bastard?!

08:25.730 --> 08:26.450
Shut the hell up!

08:26.450 --> 08:28.870
Don't talk like you're the only one here.

08:28.870 --> 08:33.330
I can take on the likes of these guys, no sweat. I'm a third dan black belt in karate!

08:31.160 --> 08:31.410
Lie

08:33.330 --> 08:36.570
You birdbrain, who do you think you're talking to?!

08:36.570 --> 08:41.850
In my previous school, everyone knew the name of Demon Itou.

08:37.380 --> 08:37.630
nobody knew him
by that name.

08:37.380 --> 08:37.630
Actually

08:40.130 --> 08:41.840
Lie

08:41.850 --> 08:45.090
If you're a demon, that makes me an angel.

08:42.590 --> 08:44.840
Lie

08:45.090 --> 08:46.450
Bullshit!

08:46.350 --> 08:48.100
Lie

08:46.450 --> 08:51.050
I'm a third dan at kendo! That makes me three times stronger than you!

08:51.050 --> 08:56.010
Yeah, whatever! Master Oyama, the best karateka in the world, is one of my homies!

08:52.850 --> 08:54.600
Lie

08:56.010 --> 08:58.090
Cut the drivel!

09:00.970 --> 09:03.100
Now you've gone and done it, you jackass!

09:04.730 --> 09:05.860
Motherfucker!

09:07.010 --> 09:08.850
Eat fist!

09:13.820 --> 09:15.530
What's with these guys?

09:15.530 --> 09:17.010
Th-They're batshit crazy.

09:17.010 --> 09:17.650
Let's leave them to it!

09:17.650 --> 09:18.970
Y-Yeah.

09:32.770 --> 09:33.220
Huh?

09:39.330 --> 09:41.330
Dammit.

09:41.330 --> 09:43.970
I didn't expect a self-styled bad boy to be that strong.

09:43.970 --> 09:46.850
I figured I'd done enough training...

09:46.850 --> 09:48.770
I was pretty confident though...

09:48.770 --> 09:49.900
Wait!

09:49.900 --> 09:53.890
That means the real<i> rebels are...</i>

09:58.930 --> 10:02.030
Maybe I shouldn't have dyed my hair so impulsively...

10:03.210 --> 10:06.250
Itou! Watch where you're walking, will ya?!

10:06.250 --> 10:09.250
You're one to talk! Don't just stand around like a statue!

10:09.250 --> 10:11.370
What're you planning to do,
following me around like this?

10:11.370 --> 10:14.000
You numskull! My house is this way!

10:14.000 --> 10:16.840
Even so, you don't have to follow me!

10:16.840 --> 10:17.720
Who's following you?!

10:19.330 --> 10:21.330
Whatever, I'm going home.

10:21.330 --> 10:22.850
Do what you like.

10:25.530 --> 10:26.690
Stop following me!

10:26.690 --> 10:28.490
Right back at ya!

10:28.490 --> 10:29.410
Get outta my way!

10:29.410 --> 10:30.690
You're the one in the way!

10:30.890 --> 10:30.890
Get outta my way!

10:31.610 --> 10:32.700
Shut the hell up!

10:35.050 --> 10:35.890
What the hell—

10:35.890 --> 10:37.650
Look where you're goi—

10:41.320 --> 10:43.860
Boys have sure got spunk these days.

10:44.650 --> 10:45.810
Now we've done it...

10:48.530 --> 10:51.540
You've got balls to run into me like that.

10:52.730 --> 10:54.250
Don't we just?!

10:57.450 --> 11:00.050
Because we're so young, we're just bursting with energy, so...

11:00.050 --> 11:01.220
We understand each other, don't we?

11:01.220 --> 11:03.010
You little...

11:03.010 --> 11:04.560
Drop the smart ass act!

11:07.050 --> 11:08.100
Where'd they go?!

11:08.100 --> 11:12.060
Shut up, pinhead. Quit acting tough!

11:18.130 --> 11:19.770
Nurikabe.

11:18.130 --> 11:19.770
<b>Translation Note</b>: In Japanese folklore, <i>Nurikabe</i> is a spirit said to take the form of a wall to misdirect travelers.

11:19.770 --> 11:23.250
Considering we're hiding, that just sounded lame.

11:23.250 --> 11:24.250
Don't call us lame.

11:24.250 --> 11:25.450
I was talking about you.

11:25.450 --> 11:26.730
Who, me?

11:36.780 --> 11:40.330
Every day is a battle for us rebels...

11:40.330 --> 11:43.330
I need something up my sleeve, at least.

11:43.970 --> 11:45.890
All right, perfect.

11:49.690 --> 11:51.410
I'm such a genius!

11:51.410 --> 11:53.890
Shut up and go to bed!

11:53.890 --> 11:55.330
Okay, okay.

12:08.530 --> 12:11.170
Running into annoyances this early in the morning...

12:12.530 --> 12:15.250
He even changes his shoes for Christ's sake!

12:16.250 --> 12:17.410
Excuse me...

12:20.930 --> 12:23.170
Honda, it's those two freaks.

12:23.170 --> 12:24.710
Yeah, you can't miss them.

12:25.210 --> 12:27.670
They aren't showing us the respect we deserve.

12:28.970 --> 12:31.610
Well, I guess I'll go teach them a lesson.

12:31.610 --> 12:33.130
Give it to them good, Sakai.

12:33.130 --> 12:33.970
Yeah.

12:35.770 --> 12:38.330
It'll be fine. Just give me a discount.

12:39.210 --> 12:41.890
Th-This isn't good... It's the third years...

12:43.210 --> 12:45.350
I'm telling you it'll be fine! Hey...

12:45.970 --> 12:49.690
Hey, Itou! They're your upperclassmen! Greet them properly!

12:54.570 --> 12:55.290
Well?

12:56.730 --> 12:59.910
Just looking at his ugly mug pisses me off.

13:00.450 --> 13:02.130
Well, what's this?

13:02.130 --> 13:06.120
You don't know how to greet your
upperclassmen, huh?

13:06.890 --> 13:08.610
I can't hear you...

13:08.610 --> 13:09.730
Rocket punch!

13:19.370 --> 13:20.760
S-Sakai!

13:21.170 --> 13:22.470
Y-You bastard!

13:25.930 --> 13:27.850
M-Mitsuhashi!

13:27.850 --> 13:28.930
You asked for it!

13:39.890 --> 13:43.450
Secret Technique: To prevent hurting one's own head, use the Urchin-Head Attack.

13:45.130 --> 13:47.730
You knucklehead! It still hurts <i>my</i> head!

13:48.410 --> 13:51.530
Well, you have to make some sacrifices.

13:51.530 --> 13:52.170
What?!

13:52.890 --> 13:54.650
Come on. It's fine, isn't it?

13:54.650 --> 13:56.450
It's not fine, dammit.

13:57.690 --> 13:59.680
You beat up the upperclassmen...

13:59.680 --> 14:01.650
They'll definitely want revenge.

14:01.650 --> 14:05.410
That ugly mug of his was getting on my nerves...

14:05.410 --> 14:08.100
Besides, it wasn't just me.

14:09.250 --> 14:11.250
You were the one who knocked out four-eyes over there.

14:11.250 --> 14:11.810
What?

14:12.370 --> 14:14.570
B-But you were the one who...

14:14.570 --> 14:17.370
How will everyone else see it, Itou?

14:17.370 --> 14:17.810
What?

14:20.250 --> 14:22.090
Don't sweat it. Don't sweat it.

14:25.250 --> 14:27.890
For some reason, I feel like I've been had.

14:42.810 --> 14:43.850
Guess there's only one way outta this.

14:51.610 --> 14:53.060
I was waiting for you, comrade!

14:53.530 --> 14:54.770
I'm not your comrade.

14:55.250 --> 14:58.330
Why do you have to be so cold, Itou?

14:58.330 --> 15:00.690
Can it, shit-for-brains!

15:00.690 --> 15:02.330
So, I guess your name is Itou.

15:02.330 --> 15:05.730
This is Fujieda, the don of Nanyou.

15:05.730 --> 15:07.490
Now, greet him properly.

15:07.970 --> 15:11.890
Hey, maybe if you're nice to him, he'll go easy on you.

15:11.890 --> 15:12.710
Right?

15:13.050 --> 15:14.530
Well?!

15:14.530 --> 15:16.670
There's no need to rush things, Sakai.

15:17.130 --> 15:19.570
Can't you see he's one of those hicks who works in the fields?

15:19.570 --> 15:22.570
Country bumpkins don't know their etiquette.

15:22.570 --> 15:24.130
Isn't that right, Itou?

15:26.490 --> 15:29.690
Now we're gonna teach you a real lesson.

15:32.810 --> 15:33.950
What do you want?

15:33.950 --> 15:35.320
I don't like being ignored!

15:37.370 --> 15:37.810
You bonehead!

15:39.170 --> 15:43.030
How long are you gonna keep talking to my sidekick? Halfwits, all of you!

15:43.030 --> 15:44.370
Mitsuhashi!

15:44.370 --> 15:46.280
You dare to go against the don?!

15:57.410 --> 16:00.000
How do you like the taste of my iron-lined satchel?

16:00.000 --> 16:01.570
M-Mitsuhashi.

16:01.570 --> 16:02.220
Y-You little fucker!

16:05.010 --> 16:05.970
H-Honda!

16:07.410 --> 16:09.050
You bastard...

16:09.050 --> 16:10.010
Looks like I have no choice.

16:10.010 --> 16:11.090
What?

16:11.090 --> 16:12.690
I'll join in too!

16:21.330 --> 16:24.850
Well, Fujieda, Mr. Gang Leader: You're the only one left.

16:26.530 --> 16:29.770
Don't you have anything to say for yourself, Fujieda?

16:29.770 --> 16:31.210
W-Wait.

16:31.210 --> 16:34.930
Calm down, Itou. We won't lay a finger on you guys again, okay?

16:35.730 --> 16:37.460
Let's let bygones be bygones.

16:38.410 --> 16:39.300
Are you serious?

16:39.300 --> 16:42.130
Y-Yeah, deadly serious. Cross my heart.

16:42.130 --> 16:42.890
We good?

16:44.890 --> 16:46.370
I told you not to ignore me!

16:50.930 --> 16:51.770
Seriously...

16:51.770 --> 16:54.140
Over already? Idiots...

16:54.610 --> 16:58.930
Damn. After I spent all night
padding my satchel with stuff...

16:58.930 --> 17:00.690
Hey, hey, stand up!

17:00.690 --> 17:02.410
What's wrong? Hey, wake up!

17:02.410 --> 17:03.570
I still have half my tricks left up my sleeve!

17:04.170 --> 17:06.410
Man! You guys suck!

17:04.570 --> 17:06.410
Th-This guy...

17:15.930 --> 17:20.080
This is crazy. I even managed to take out their ringleader.

17:21.210 --> 17:22.650
I guess I really am tough, after all.

17:22.650 --> 17:23.810
Not just a regular guy.

17:24.250 --> 17:26.770
Those "real" rebels aren't even scary.

17:27.510 --> 17:30.170
Of course! I'm invincible!

17:31.250 --> 17:35.470
But I still have to deal with that bastard, Itou...

17:35.170 --> 17:35.670
Sea

17:35.670 --> 17:36.180
urchin

17:36.010 --> 17:37.930
That urchin-head...

17:36.180 --> 17:36.680
Sea

17:36.680 --> 17:37.180
urchin

17:37.180 --> 17:37.630
Sea

17:38.570 --> 17:41.730
Maybe he's stronger than he looks...

17:41.730 --> 17:44.650
I don't think that's the case though.

17:49.410 --> 17:51.890
What's your problem? What the hell are you looking at?!

17:51.890 --> 17:53.240
Don't you know how tough I am?!

18:00.930 --> 18:02.170
He's huge...

18:02.170 --> 18:04.490
He must be at least 6'3"...

18:04.490 --> 18:07.770
and he looks pretty strong too.

18:07.770 --> 18:08.810
Get off at the next stop.

18:09.810 --> 18:10.510
Sure thing!

18:35.090 --> 18:36.250
This way.

18:36.250 --> 18:37.050
All right.

18:41.570 --> 18:45.370
So you think you can just eye-fuck Imai of Beni High and get away with it?

18:46.530 --> 18:47.050
H-Huh?

18:48.410 --> 18:49.650
Bye-bye!

18:51.490 --> 18:52.980
Y-You little shit!

18:53.610 --> 18:57.370
You moron. I don't have time to play with the likes of you.

19:10.530 --> 19:12.110
I'll kill you!

19:18.410 --> 19:20.490
T-Time out! Time out!

19:20.490 --> 19:21.290
Wait a second!

19:25.880 --> 19:26.850
Wait!

19:27.650 --> 19:28.810
Wait!

19:28.810 --> 19:29.850
Stop!

19:29.850 --> 19:30.810
Ouch!

19:34.650 --> 19:35.490
Clumsy oaf.

19:49.810 --> 19:52.570
I'll murder that blond shrimp.

19:52.570 --> 19:54.610
I swear I'll get him one day...

20:04.330 --> 20:05.830
What? Girls?

20:06.550 --> 20:10.150
What? They heard about me and want my autograph?

20:10.150 --> 20:11.270
Th-That's...

20:11.670 --> 20:13.720
What?! Bad girls?!

20:14.390 --> 20:18.790
So I kicked three kinds of shit out of that dweeb who was checking me out.

20:18.790 --> 20:20.150
He must have really had it coming.

20:20.150 --> 20:21.690
Sure did.

20:28.750 --> 20:31.830
Knowing girls like that are waiting for me doesn't exactly thrill me.

20:31.830 --> 20:35.530
You should try looking in a mirror before saying that.

20:36.470 --> 20:38.230
Okay, Itou, off you go.

20:38.230 --> 20:38.990
What?

20:38.990 --> 20:41.470
Anyway, I'm sure they only came looking for a fight or whatever.

20:41.470 --> 20:44.000
Maybe you'll manage to cop a feel of their boobs.

20:45.350 --> 20:48.110
I don't fight girls.

20:49.040 --> 20:52.510
I'd never expect chivalry from a no-good, dirty cheat like you!

20:52.510 --> 20:56.190
Coming from <i>you</i>, that makes me die a little inside.

20:56.190 --> 20:59.480
Okay, okay, in that case, go and die for real!

21:08.110 --> 21:09.950
Are you Mitsuhashi?

21:09.950 --> 21:12.510
No! I'm Itou!

21:12.510 --> 21:14.870
Mitsuhashi was scared of you girls, so he ran away.

21:14.870 --> 21:17.350
He's a double-crossing little momma's boy and—

21:21.590 --> 21:23.160
I'm Mitsuhashi.

21:23.160 --> 21:25.510
What do you want?

21:25.510 --> 21:27.790
Actually, we wanted to ask you a favor.

21:28.310 --> 21:32.230
Sorry, but I gotta have a reason to listen to favors...

21:32.230 --> 21:33.830
A-Aw nuts...

21:33.830 --> 21:35.230
What'll we do?

21:35.230 --> 21:37.260
Sorry I'm late!

21:44.830 --> 21:45.790
Kyouko!

21:45.790 --> 21:48.550
How'd it go? Did you find Mitsuhashi?

21:48.550 --> 21:49.870
W-Well...

21:49.870 --> 21:50.690
Wait.

21:51.070 --> 21:52.990
I will listen to your request.

21:52.990 --> 21:55.630
Mitsuhashi is the kind of pond scum that doesn't listen to what people have to—

22:00.230 --> 22:02.190
I shall listen to what you have to say.

22:02.190 --> 22:05.910
Helping damsels in distress is a man's duty!

22:06.350 --> 22:07.910
Y-Yeah...

22:10.910 --> 22:13.270
You're gonna get run over if you take a nap there.

22:17.790 --> 22:19.790
I see...

22:19.790 --> 22:27.070
Basically, you want us to teach those guys who keep harassing you a lesson, right?

22:27.070 --> 22:29.520
Yeah, they're so persistent.

22:30.190 --> 22:32.750
Okay, we'll do it.

22:33.510 --> 22:34.440
You mean it?

22:34.790 --> 22:36.270
Of course.

22:36.270 --> 22:40.950
By the way, for my reward, how about you give me your bod—

22:42.350 --> 22:44.530
N-Naturally, we're not asking for any reward.

22:44.870 --> 22:46.470
O-Okay.

22:53.660 --> 22:57.160
Seiran Girls'
Academy

23:08.990 --> 23:10.190
How cute!

23:10.190 --> 23:11.980
Suits you.

23:12.390 --> 23:14.470
Y-You think so?

23:14.470 --> 23:15.870
But this hag's pretty ugly, isn't she?

23:15.870 --> 23:17.110
What?

23:17.110 --> 23:18.310
Like totally.

23:18.310 --> 23:19.940
No! Stop it!

23:22.870 --> 23:24.990
My, aren't you ladies pretty?

23:23.550 --> 23:24.650
Like hell I would!

23:24.650 --> 23:25.470
Let us through!

23:24.990 --> 23:25.870
This is standard fare for an all-girls' school.

23:25.470 --> 23:25.870
Don't touch me!

23:26.470 --> 23:28.310
So they came today as well...

23:28.310 --> 23:31.510
They think they can do whatever they like because this is an all-girls' school.

23:31.510 --> 23:32.990
I see.

23:32.990 --> 23:36.310
Leave those guys to me.

23:37.350 --> 23:39.510
Hey there, fellas.

23:42.950 --> 23:44.910
What's with the giantess?

23:44.910 --> 23:46.430
We've got no use for ugly bitches.

23:46.430 --> 23:48.070
Run along home, you hear?

23:49.950 --> 23:51.110
What was that?

23:51.110 --> 23:52.850
Who are you calling <i>ugly</i>?!

23:54.350 --> 23:55.980
Invincible

24:02.430 --> 24:04.230
You sleazebags...

24:04.230 --> 24:06.270
Aren't you ashamed that you got beaten up by a pair of girls?

24:06.270 --> 24:07.580
Don't ever come here again.

24:08.110 --> 24:12.950
The only guys who can even match us are Nanyou's Mitsuhashi and his sidekick, Itou.

24:12.950 --> 24:15.430
Who're you calling a <i>sidekick</i>?!

24:15.430 --> 24:16.790
You aren't hurt, are you?

24:17.310 --> 24:20.950
Thank you so much! You've rescued us from them.

24:21.830 --> 24:25.430
Instead of saying thank you, how about giving me a kiss?

24:28.030 --> 24:29.430
Seriously, this idiot...

24:31.870 --> 24:36.630
U-Um, if they come by hitting on you girls again, just let me know.

24:36.630 --> 24:38.070
I'll come running.

24:40.670 --> 24:42.290
Yes, we're counting on you.

24:42.630 --> 24:44.570
Just ask for Itou. They'll
know who you mean.

24:46.070 --> 24:47.390
Well, laters.

24:52.790 --> 24:53.790
Bye.

24:57.830 --> 24:59.070
Itou...

25:01.460 --> 25:02.000
The wig! The wig!

25:07.430 --> 25:09.350
I-I forgot to change!

25:09.350 --> 25:11.060
Oh, so you did.

25:21.870 --> 25:22.950
What?

25:22.950 --> 25:24.590
You found blondie?

25:24.590 --> 25:27.030
So who the hell is he?

25:27.030 --> 25:27.790
Oh, yes.

25:27.790 --> 25:31.490
He just transferred to Nanyou. His name's Mitsuhashi.

25:32.070 --> 25:35.470
Ah, that explains why I hadn't seen his face before.

25:35.470 --> 25:36.340
Oh well.

25:36.750 --> 25:42.430
I'm gonna pound that transfer student or whoever the hell he is into the pavement...

25:42.430 --> 25:44.990
Y-You'd be better off just letting it go.

25:44.990 --> 25:47.550
Why? Is he really that strong?

25:47.910 --> 25:51.150
No, but I hear he fights dirty.

25:52.220 --> 25:53.830
I-Idiot!

25:53.830 --> 25:55.950
I don't care if he fights dirty or not!

25:55.950 --> 25:58.510
He made me look stupid and that's something I can't let slide!

25:58.510 --> 26:01.870
If he fights dirty, I'll just fight dirtier!

26:02.390 --> 26:04.030
Anyway, I'm a badass.

26:04.030 --> 26:05.390
Nothing scares me!

26:07.350 --> 26:10.350
That'll be 154 yen after tax.

26:11.150 --> 26:12.350
I only have a hundred on me...

26:14.710 --> 26:16.550
Shit...

26:17.750 --> 26:19.790
Those fat crackwhores!

26:19.790 --> 26:22.230
They've made a laughing stock out of us!

26:22.230 --> 26:23.590
What are we gonna do about it?

26:23.590 --> 26:25.000
They were hard as nails.

26:25.750 --> 26:28.030
We won't win if we fight fair.

26:28.030 --> 26:29.970
We need to come up with a plan.

26:30.590 --> 26:32.310
How about we take a hostage?

26:32.310 --> 26:32.930
But who?

26:33.350 --> 26:35.640
How about that Kyouko girl?

26:36.070 --> 26:38.750
You mean their ringleader?

26:38.750 --> 26:39.790
That's a good idea.

26:39.790 --> 26:40.850
All right, it's settled.

26:48.070 --> 26:49.790
Imai!

26:49.790 --> 26:51.870
How far down are you going to dig?

26:53.310 --> 26:56.230
If you keep going, we'll strike oil!

26:56.230 --> 26:57.430
You bonehead!

26:57.430 --> 27:00.410
When it comes to pitfall traps, the deeper they are, the better!

27:01.350 --> 27:05.230
As for you, stop standing around and go deliver that challenge letter.

27:05.230 --> 27:06.270
Y-You got it.

27:06.270 --> 27:10.310
When that bastard Mitsuhashi gets here, it'll be the end of him!

27:12.590 --> 27:16.230
But are you sure it's all right to dig a hole this big here?

27:16.230 --> 27:18.310
Like I care! I'm an evil sonovabitch!

27:18.310 --> 27:19.910
S-So you are!

27:21.750 --> 27:22.630
Eat dirt!

27:23.510 --> 27:25.230
What are you idiots doing?!

27:25.230 --> 27:27.510
Stop them, Tanigawa!

27:27.510 --> 27:29.030
Not likely...

27:30.750 --> 27:33.070
"Just hurry up and die already, dumbass."

27:33.070 --> 27:38.110
"You think you're so cool, don'tcha, you slant-eyed bastard?"

27:38.110 --> 27:42.270
"If that offends you, meet me at Nohara Park at 4pm today."

27:42.270 --> 27:44.000
"Imai Katsutoshi."

27:44.590 --> 27:45.870
So that's how it is.

27:45.870 --> 27:48.470
That brainless dolt I met on the train is called Imai.

27:48.470 --> 27:51.550
H-He is indeed. And um, your reply...

27:51.550 --> 27:56.230
A drip of this caliber is the don of Beni High School?

27:56.430 --> 27:59.110
Uh, yeah, I guess he is.

27:59.110 --> 28:00.710
I see...

28:00.710 --> 28:02.350
I understand.

28:02.350 --> 28:05.550
Tell that bastard Imai that I'll be there, come rain or shine!

28:07.110 --> 28:09.830
O-Okay!

28:09.830 --> 28:11.390
Dammit.

28:11.390 --> 28:13.230
That attention whore sure pisses me off.

28:13.230 --> 28:15.350
Shall I come help out?

28:15.350 --> 28:16.950
I don't need your help!

28:16.950 --> 28:19.150
Itou!

28:19.150 --> 28:20.630
Where are you?

28:20.630 --> 28:22.150
Itou!

28:22.150 --> 28:24.270
Hey, what's up?

28:24.950 --> 28:25.620
Itou!

28:26.110 --> 28:27.590
K-Kyouko is...

28:27.590 --> 28:28.870
What?

28:29.550 --> 28:30.950
What's happened to Kyouko?!

28:58.150 --> 28:59.110
Those rat bastards.

28:59.590 --> 29:03.310
And they told us we should bring the two girls who beat them up to them...

29:03.310 --> 29:04.110
And the location?

29:04.110 --> 29:06.200
The abandoned Kasumi Factory.

29:06.590 --> 29:08.950
Right! I'll take care of it!

29:08.950 --> 29:10.870
O-kay.

29:10.870 --> 29:13.710
I'll leave it to you then, "little lady."

29:14.590 --> 29:15.460
V!

29:23.830 --> 29:27.380
Watanabe Real

29:23.830 --> 29:27.380
Estate

29:23.830 --> 29:27.380
No Trespassing

29:42.950 --> 29:45.200
...and I beat them up good...

29:45.550 --> 29:47.750
I don't see Kyouko anywhere...

29:48.990 --> 29:51.390
There were five of the bastards. Five.

29:57.510 --> 29:58.550
Um...

29:58.550 --> 29:59.390
What?

29:59.390 --> 30:01.510
Are you really gonna let
Itou go in by himself?

30:01.510 --> 30:03.350
He'll be fine... probably.

30:03.350 --> 30:05.990
I think it'd be best if you went with him, after all.

30:05.990 --> 30:06.830
Don't sweat it.

30:06.830 --> 30:07.710
Why?

30:07.710 --> 30:10.030
Even if Itou gets beaten up, he'll have worn them out.

30:10.030 --> 30:12.150
Then, I'll go in and give them a good hiding.

30:12.150 --> 30:13.680
The strongest guy gets the girl.

30:17.190 --> 30:20.270
One of the five was a real wuss.

30:20.270 --> 30:23.750
He got so scared, he just turned tail and ran away!

30:25.670 --> 30:27.320
You're late!

30:28.190 --> 30:30.990
It appears our idol isn't here.

30:30.990 --> 30:31.780
Where is she?

30:31.780 --> 30:33.190
Same to you!

30:33.190 --> 30:34.750
Where's the blonde?

30:35.190 --> 30:38.460
Sorry, but unfortunately, you're only getting me today.

30:39.030 --> 30:42.420
She ate too much and now has rectum-destroying diarrhea.

30:42.750 --> 30:44.470
You think you're funny?!

30:44.470 --> 30:47.130
We wanted to tear both of you limb from limb!

30:48.310 --> 30:49.990
Isn't that interesting?

30:50.790 --> 30:53.550
Who's gonna tear who limb from limb?

30:53.550 --> 30:57.600
It appears you haven't quite
grasped the situation, little missy.

30:58.630 --> 30:59.350
What do you mean?

30:59.750 --> 31:01.550
Can't you tell just by looking?

31:01.550 --> 31:03.820
Kyouko isn't here.

31:03.820 --> 31:08.820
In other words, if you're obedient, Kyouko goes home, safe and sound.

31:09.550 --> 31:11.950
But if you don't do as you're told... Get the point?

31:11.950 --> 31:14.830
Who knows what'll happen to that girlie when we all get our hands on her...

31:19.250 --> 31:20.000
You're bluffing.

31:20.000 --> 31:22.670
Guess we'll see about that.

31:22.670 --> 31:26.510
All we wanna do is beat the shit out of you.

31:30.070 --> 31:33.150
So if I don't fight, Kyouko will return safe and sound. Is that it?

31:40.630 --> 31:41.910
Do as you please.

31:42.830 --> 31:45.790
But in return, don't lay a finger on Kyouko.

31:45.790 --> 31:46.360
You got that?

31:47.590 --> 31:49.830
Good girl.

31:49.830 --> 31:52.570
Looks like you aren't just another brainless twerp.

31:53.150 --> 31:56.430
Well, what should we do with you, huh?

31:57.110 --> 31:59.540
Come on, say something!

31:59.950 --> 32:01.270
I-It's a wig!

32:01.270 --> 32:05.000
Th-This guy... It's Itou from Nanyou!

32:05.830 --> 32:07.210
So what if I am?

32:07.510 --> 32:09.150
You bastard!

32:09.150 --> 32:10.170
Don't fuck with us!

32:13.470 --> 32:14.910
Mitsuhashi.

32:17.510 --> 32:18.790
Mitsuhashi.

32:18.790 --> 32:19.350
Huh?

32:19.910 --> 32:22.030
He's been in there for thirty minutes...

32:22.030 --> 32:22.870
What?!

32:22.870 --> 32:23.950
Dammit!

32:23.950 --> 32:26.940
If I find him flirting with her, he's a dead man!

32:31.350 --> 32:32.870
What's with that guy?

32:32.870 --> 32:34.320
Who knows...

32:38.110 --> 32:40.670
So you tricked us by cross-dressing, huh?

32:40.670 --> 32:43.290
You've got one helluva sick fetish there.

32:43.630 --> 32:45.510
Say something!

32:50.190 --> 32:51.230
Have you finished already?

32:52.110 --> 32:52.510
What?!

33:04.870 --> 33:05.390
Shut up!

33:05.390 --> 33:06.710
Keep it down in there!

33:08.110 --> 33:09.270
Come on, say—

33:10.610 --> 33:13.390
What? You're still at it?

33:13.390 --> 33:15.070
Well, looks like you forced my hand.

33:18.990 --> 33:22.390
Huh? Why are you lying down on the job, Itou?

33:22.390 --> 33:23.510
Hey!

33:23.510 --> 33:24.870
Itou.

33:25.510 --> 33:26.270
Hello in there!

33:26.950 --> 33:29.070
Hm, there's no answer.

33:29.070 --> 33:30.830
Hey! Motherfucker!

33:30.830 --> 33:32.910
I wonder what happened...

33:32.150 --> 33:32.910
Hey!

33:32.910 --> 33:34.470
Don't ignore us!

33:36.390 --> 33:37.950
Damn, you're noisy.

33:37.950 --> 33:40.150
So you're Mitsuhashi, huh?

33:41.070 --> 33:43.390
This one's a bit of a joker, isn't he?

33:43.390 --> 33:44.310
Oh?

33:44.310 --> 33:45.600
Who's joking?

33:46.070 --> 33:47.560
Hey, dipshit! We're talking about you!

33:48.230 --> 33:51.830
I repeat: Who's joking?

33:51.830 --> 33:55.470
Idiot! Don't let him scare you! We have a hostage, remember!

33:57.030 --> 33:58.750
Cat's got your tongue now, huh?

33:58.750 --> 33:59.550
Go on!

33:59.550 --> 34:00.910
Say something now!

34:05.910 --> 34:07.430
That hurt.

34:07.430 --> 34:09.310
That hurt like a bitch, you dick.

34:10.190 --> 34:11.630
What's with this guy?

34:13.110 --> 34:17.220
So this is the kinda pain you bastards inflicted on Itou?

34:17.910 --> 34:18.640
Shut the fuck up!

34:30.510 --> 34:32.550
Y-You motherfucker! What the hell did you <i>do</i>?!

34:33.590 --> 34:35.310
Looks like I pounded him good.

34:35.310 --> 34:37.740
I put a suspension spring from a motorcycle in my satchel.

34:37.740 --> 34:38.790
Wh-What?!

34:38.790 --> 34:40.150
That's gotta hurt!

34:43.550 --> 34:47.870
Dammit, this thing is such a pain to reload.

34:48.620 --> 34:50.630
Enough with your bullshit!

34:59.030 --> 35:00.590
Secret Technique: Sandbag Attack.

35:01.190 --> 35:03.560
Th-That's fighting dirty, you scumbag!

35:04.100 --> 35:05.520
What was that? I can't hear you.

35:05.870 --> 35:08.230
Don't forget that we have a hostage!

35:09.670 --> 35:10.550
Ow...

35:10.550 --> 35:12.670
Man, you make such a racket...

35:12.670 --> 35:14.190
I can't hear him!

35:15.320 --> 35:18.750
So who's the one playing dirty here?

35:18.750 --> 35:19.510
B-But...

35:19.510 --> 35:22.620
If you lay a hand on us, Kyouko won't walk away from this.

35:23.430 --> 35:26.580
Isn't taking hostages playing dirty?

35:27.670 --> 35:34.380
When people like you spout nonsense, it goes in one ear and out the other!

35:41.910 --> 35:44.830
This is what happens to people who fuck with me.

35:50.150 --> 35:53.230
Oh crap, I forgot to ask where Kyouko is.

35:56.110 --> 35:56.940
Kyouko!

35:58.790 --> 36:00.310
Thank goodness.

36:00.310 --> 36:01.470
Are you okay?

36:01.470 --> 36:02.870
Are you injured?

36:13.470 --> 36:14.350
Itou!

36:14.350 --> 36:15.460
Huh?

36:15.460 --> 36:18.990
Sorry, this was all because of me...

36:18.990 --> 36:19.920
I'm sorry!

36:20.470 --> 36:21.590
Kyouko.

36:24.630 --> 36:30.310
One, two, three, four, five, six, seven, eight...

36:36.710 --> 36:38.870
Shit...

36:39.550 --> 36:42.670
Itou, that dickwad... It has to be a sick joke.

36:42.670 --> 36:45.030
Even though I was the guy who saved her...

36:45.030 --> 36:49.290
Women! I just can't figure them out.

36:49.290 --> 36:51.790
Ryo, hurry up!

36:52.310 --> 36:54.030
Watch where you're going, asshole!

36:54.030 --> 36:57.270
Wait up, Riko!

36:58.030 --> 36:59.950
That stupid bitch.

36:59.950 --> 37:01.990
If I see her again, I'll teach her a lesson.

37:01.990 --> 37:03.750
You're gonna pay!

37:05.190 --> 37:06.150
Huh?

37:06.150 --> 37:09.220
I feel like I'm forgetting something...

37:09.550 --> 37:12.230
Hm, what was it?

37:12.230 --> 37:13.150
Huh?

37:29.030 --> 37:30.270
Imai.

37:30.270 --> 37:31.350
Yeah?

37:31.350 --> 37:34.590
Mitsuhashi sure is late, isn't he?

37:34.590 --> 37:35.040
Yeah.

37:36.950 --> 37:38.830
Um, maybe he—

37:38.830 --> 37:40.190
Don't say it, Tanigawa.

37:40.190 --> 37:42.590
Okay. Sorry.

37:46.150 --> 37:47.230
Imai.

37:47.230 --> 37:48.550
Yeah?

37:48.550 --> 37:52.910
I'll stick by you forever.

37:52.910 --> 37:54.190
Right...

38:00.710 --> 38:02.470
What? The Shadow Boss?

38:02.470 --> 38:05.990
Yeah, I hear he's looking for Mitsuhashi.

38:05.990 --> 38:07.820
He hasn't been heard from in a while...

38:08.270 --> 38:09.950
Who's this "Shadow Boss"?

38:09.950 --> 38:11.870
What? You don't know?

38:11.870 --> 38:14.590
Isn't Fujieda the don around here?

38:14.590 --> 38:16.790
That's just a title he gave himself.

38:16.790 --> 38:19.390
Rumor has it he bought his title.

38:32.910 --> 38:34.100
You're Mitsuhashi?

38:34.510 --> 38:35.310
Who the hell are you?

38:36.110 --> 38:38.190
How dare you. Who the—

38:36.990 --> 38:38.190
Wait.

38:38.510 --> 38:44.870
We let you guys fight around town so that everyone'd know how badass our school is.

38:44.870 --> 38:45.670
Mitsuhashi...

38:45.670 --> 38:47.110
Oh? What's your point?

38:47.790 --> 38:51.230
As long as you keep your nose out of our business, I let it slide.

38:51.230 --> 38:55.310
But when you go near my friends, that's when we have ourselves a problem.

38:57.230 --> 39:00.040
This guy's been my friend since middle school.

39:00.550 --> 39:03.750
Beating you up is a game to us.

39:03.750 --> 39:06.510
We don't like to work without getting paid.

39:07.470 --> 39:09.720
Looks like you're smarter than the other little hoodlums.

39:10.350 --> 39:15.150
Kawai's hospital bills and your little "apology" add up to ¥300,000, don't they, Shiratori?

39:15.150 --> 39:15.680
Yeah.

39:17.140 --> 39:19.590
It's not a bad offer...

39:19.590 --> 39:24.570
You can keep stirring up shit and even call yourself a "boss," as long as you pay us.

39:24.990 --> 39:25.690
One...

39:26.070 --> 39:26.860
two...

39:26.860 --> 39:27.710
three...

39:27.710 --> 39:28.790
four...

39:28.790 --> 39:29.830
five...

39:29.830 --> 39:30.750
six...

39:32.110 --> 39:34.410
Six of them are carrying sticks.

39:35.750 --> 39:37.110
What are you talking about?

39:37.110 --> 39:40.250
None of you could even beat up a freshman, one on one.

39:40.630 --> 39:41.460
What did you say?!

39:41.910 --> 39:44.420
Do you do anything on your own?

39:44.420 --> 39:47.510
This is only half of our little gang, Mitsuhashi.

39:47.510 --> 39:53.600
At this very moment, your partner-in-crime is coughing up money for us elsewhere.

39:54.030 --> 39:54.910
What?!

39:56.140 --> 39:57.560
You bastards!

40:17.110 --> 40:19.070
Damn, you're a stubborn mule!

40:19.070 --> 40:20.590
¥300,000 is our price!

40:20.590 --> 40:21.750
You hear, Itou?

40:23.990 --> 40:25.460
Wh-Who's gonna...

40:25.460 --> 40:26.950
F-Fucker!

40:26.950 --> 40:27.950
Wait!

40:27.950 --> 40:29.830
He can't even stand.

40:29.830 --> 40:31.430
Also, I'm worried about the others.

40:31.990 --> 40:33.070
Let's get outta here.

40:33.070 --> 40:34.190
Yeah.

40:34.190 --> 40:36.110
How long are you just gonna lie there?!

40:36.110 --> 40:36.950
Sorry.

40:36.950 --> 40:37.630
Ow.

40:37.630 --> 40:38.750
Shit.

40:48.510 --> 40:50.150
You're the only one left standing.

40:53.910 --> 40:55.700
Guess it's up to me.

40:56.630 --> 40:57.990
Tough guy, huh?

40:57.990 --> 40:59.430
Shiratori!

41:00.190 --> 41:00.950
Oh shit!

41:01.710 --> 41:02.750
How many of them are there?!

41:16.190 --> 41:18.110
Are you all right, Shiratori?

41:18.110 --> 41:19.260
It's about damn time!

41:19.260 --> 41:20.630
Sorry.

41:20.630 --> 41:22.590
Well, did you take care of Itou?

41:23.310 --> 41:26.230
Yeah, it took longer than we thought, though.

41:28.070 --> 41:30.190
Is this doofus gonna be all right?

41:31.470 --> 41:32.550
He's fine.

41:32.550 --> 41:34.660
Head wounds always gush like that.

41:37.390 --> 41:39.030
You get it now, Mitsuhashi?

41:39.030 --> 41:41.830
You're just a small fry who got his ass kicked.

41:42.350 --> 41:45.510
You'd better look different next time you show up at school.

41:45.510 --> 41:47.310
And don't forget our money.

41:47.310 --> 41:50.590
What a dingbat, taking a nap in the street!

42:07.710 --> 42:09.630
Itou!

42:10.910 --> 42:11.510
Yo.

42:11.510 --> 42:13.280
So they beat you up too, huh?

42:15.310 --> 42:17.310
You look awful.

42:17.310 --> 42:19.230
Mind you, you looked awful from the start, so...

42:19.230 --> 42:22.200
What happened to your hair?

42:23.550 --> 42:25.160
Oh, my hair?

42:27.670 --> 42:30.380
I'm done with being a badass.

42:30.380 --> 42:31.310
What?

42:31.310 --> 42:32.910
The time is right.

42:32.910 --> 42:36.630
You're better off not messing with guys like that.

42:36.630 --> 42:37.550
So you mean you're—

42:37.550 --> 42:40.760
Yes, from this day forward, I'm gonna be a playboy.

42:40.760 --> 42:42.470
A self-styled playboy?!

42:42.220 --> 42:44.270
A self-styled playboy...

42:43.990 --> 42:46.950
is not someone who turns into a playboy by chance,

42:46.950 --> 42:50.270
but someone who wakes up one day and <i>decides</i> to be a playboy.

42:51.440 --> 42:52.730
Exactly!

42:52.730 --> 42:54.710
I've started using hair mousse...

42:54.710 --> 42:57.070
my uniform is medium-length...

42:57.070 --> 42:59.550
and naturally, a good pair of springy basketball shoes.

42:59.550 --> 43:02.410
All I need now is a tan and my
image change will be complete.

43:02.790 --> 43:03.870
Mitsuhashi.

43:04.430 --> 43:06.270
You should give it up too, man.

43:06.270 --> 43:08.750
If you're gonna get yourself beat up all the time, it'll make Kyouko sad.

43:08.750 --> 43:09.580
Mitsuhashi!

43:09.910 --> 43:11.510
What are you thinking?!

43:11.510 --> 43:12.550
Wh-What do you mean?

43:12.550 --> 43:14.190
You don't regret your image change?

43:14.190 --> 43:15.590
Not at all.

43:15.590 --> 43:18.790
So that whole bad boy
shtick was just for show?

43:18.790 --> 43:19.510
Looks like.

43:19.510 --> 43:20.670
Mitsuhashi!

43:20.670 --> 43:24.180
Take that rod out of your ass, Itou.

43:24.180 --> 43:25.270
Itou...

43:25.270 --> 43:27.750
Let me give you some good advice.

43:27.750 --> 43:28.810
What?

43:29.270 --> 43:31.710
Always yield to the alpha males.

43:34.830 --> 43:36.230
You...

43:36.230 --> 43:37.830
Wh-What's your problem?

43:40.430 --> 43:41.350
We're through.

43:41.350 --> 43:42.470
Starting today, you're on your own.

43:42.470 --> 43:43.450
Fine by me.

43:47.630 --> 43:49.590
Wait, is that Mitsuhashi?

43:49.590 --> 43:51.710
What happened to your hair?

43:53.380 --> 43:57.110
I lost a fight, so I decided to become a playboy instead.

43:57.110 --> 43:59.030
I liked your hair better before...

43:59.030 --> 44:00.180
Really?

44:00.590 --> 44:03.310
Oh, I know! Let's go do karaoke some time!

44:03.310 --> 44:04.350
Whaddaya say?

44:12.310 --> 44:15.070
In all honesty, I'm gobsmacked, Mitsuhashi.

44:16.230 --> 44:19.900
You're pathetic. You would've come out better if you'd just lost a fight.

44:24.870 --> 44:26.750
What the hell you looking at?

44:26.750 --> 44:28.670
What's with that hairdo?

44:28.670 --> 44:31.540
Are you having problems understanding what we explained to you?

44:32.430 --> 44:33.500
Shut up...

44:33.990 --> 44:34.460
What was that?!

44:35.230 --> 44:37.800
You're worthless without your gang,

44:37.800 --> 44:39.170
so stop acting like you're<i> hard !</i>

44:41.880 --> 44:44.350
Library Processing Room

44:52.870 --> 44:54.270
Discard.

44:54.590 --> 44:57.030
Tch, I only need one goddamn tile.

45:00.750 --> 45:02.010
Shiratori!

45:03.070 --> 45:04.350
What's going on here, Kubo?

45:04.350 --> 45:06.080
Th-That motherfucker, Itou...

45:06.510 --> 45:07.160
What?

45:08.270 --> 45:09.580
That bastard again...

45:09.990 --> 45:11.310
Rally the gang!

45:11.310 --> 45:12.120
We're gonna teach him a lesson!

45:17.430 --> 45:20.270
Mitsuhashi, you're gross!

45:21.310 --> 45:22.720
Yo, Mitsuhashi.

45:22.720 --> 45:25.070
Shiratori...

45:26.630 --> 45:30.510
Hey, everyone, are you guys off for a little walk?

45:30.510 --> 45:33.150
Yeah, we're on our way
to teach Itou a lesson.

45:33.150 --> 45:34.470
Wanna tag?

45:34.470 --> 45:35.710
No, thanks!

45:35.710 --> 45:37.630
I've given up on all that.

45:37.630 --> 45:39.610
I see you've hit the straight and narrow.

45:39.610 --> 45:41.270
By the way, Shiratori...

45:41.270 --> 45:41.900
What is it?

45:42.310 --> 45:44.350
About the money I owe...

45:44.350 --> 45:46.470
Can you wait a teensy-weensy bit longer?

45:46.470 --> 45:47.910
Pass the sick bucket.

45:47.910 --> 45:50.030
I'll come up with the goods eventually...

45:50.030 --> 45:51.040
Okay, okay.

45:51.710 --> 45:53.120
You mean it?

45:53.430 --> 45:54.630
Thank you so much!

45:54.630 --> 45:55.910
Come on, let's go.

45:55.910 --> 45:57.150
Bye-bye now!

45:57.150 --> 45:58.790
Good luck!

46:02.790 --> 46:04.310
What was all that?

46:04.310 --> 46:06.150
You don't usually act like that.

46:07.030 --> 46:07.800
It's fine, don't sweat it.

46:07.800 --> 46:09.030
Anyway, let's go.

46:09.030 --> 46:12.520
So this karaoke place has a
whole bunch of anime songs...

46:12.520 --> 46:13.350
What?

46:13.350 --> 46:15.310
I didn't know you were an anime fanboy.

46:21.430 --> 46:23.590
Blond, remember. Keep your eyes peeled for that blond guy.

46:23.590 --> 46:24.280
Right.

46:24.870 --> 46:27.550
That bastard. He won't escape me today.

46:27.550 --> 46:30.280
Yeah. Today will be his day of reckoning.

46:31.190 --> 46:35.250
Exactly! And his singing was just so bad!

46:32.430 --> 46:34.070
He's late.

46:34.070 --> 46:35.250
What's keeping him?

46:35.750 --> 46:38.590
Well, he's brain-dead, so he
probably had to stay behind.

46:38.590 --> 46:40.390
Yeah, that figures.

47:04.310 --> 47:05.510
Imai.

47:05.510 --> 47:06.950
What is it?

47:06.950 --> 47:11.150
Maybe he ran off before we got here.

47:11.150 --> 47:12.790
Maybe...

47:12.790 --> 47:15.310
We should've sprinted here after we got off the train.

47:15.310 --> 47:16.330
Yeah...

47:16.330 --> 47:18.150
We should've...

47:26.430 --> 47:29.910
Are you sure you shouldn't go to the hospital?

47:29.910 --> 47:31.870
Yeah, they're only bruises.

47:31.870 --> 47:35.830
But I wonder if Mitsuhashi really is going to live like a playboy from now on...

47:36.950 --> 47:38.390
Kyouko.

47:38.390 --> 47:41.070
Don't mention his name when you're around me.

47:41.070 --> 47:41.800
But...

47:42.150 --> 47:44.720
I'm nothing like that coward!

47:59.610 --> 48:00.980
Good morning!

48:00.980 --> 48:02.230
Oh, good morning.

48:02.230 --> 48:03.870
This rain's such a pain in the ass.

48:03.870 --> 48:07.700
Oh, did you hear about Itou?

48:07.700 --> 48:09.160
What? I haven't heard anything.

48:09.470 --> 48:12.670
He was beaten up by the third years yesterday.

48:12.670 --> 48:15.620
It was crazy. Sounded like there were at least ten of them.

48:15.620 --> 48:17.670
Really?

48:17.670 --> 48:18.630
That idiot.

48:18.630 --> 48:20.090
Oh, Mitsuhashi.

48:20.470 --> 48:22.870
Aren't there more scratches on your face than there were yesterday?

48:22.870 --> 48:23.300
Huh?

48:23.710 --> 48:26.260
Not likely. Are you sure you're not just imagining things?

48:26.870 --> 48:29.390
Besides, I'm a playboy now.

48:29.390 --> 48:30.710
You sure are.

48:33.520 --> 48:33.610
Library Processing Room

48:34.470 --> 48:35.690
What?

48:36.150 --> 48:38.650
Matsuzaki and Takeuchi were hospitalized?

48:38.650 --> 48:39.830
You heard right.

48:39.830 --> 48:41.360
I wonder if it was that chickenshit, Itou.

48:41.830 --> 48:43.190
There's no way it'd be him.

48:43.190 --> 48:45.070
Not after the beating we gave him yesterday.

48:45.070 --> 48:47.670
Then, it couldn't have been... Mitsuhashi?!

48:47.670 --> 48:48.780
Surely not...

48:51.630 --> 48:53.270
Itou!

48:53.270 --> 48:54.470
I came to play.

48:54.470 --> 48:55.790
Itou!

48:55.790 --> 48:57.150
So it was you after all!

49:11.910 --> 49:14.390
What goes through that pea-brain of yours?

49:14.390 --> 49:16.640
You still don't get it, do you?

49:20.650 --> 49:23.230
What's wrong? That all you got?

49:24.670 --> 49:25.950
What's with this nutjob?

49:26.710 --> 49:28.070
Sh-Shiratori!

49:28.070 --> 49:29.910
No matter how much you beat me, I'll get back up again.

49:30.430 --> 49:32.190
You've left us with few options.

49:32.190 --> 49:34.870
Make it so that he can't pick up his wooden stick for a while.

49:34.870 --> 49:35.830
What?

49:45.950 --> 49:47.090
Don't!

50:04.190 --> 50:05.670
Mitsuhashi!

50:05.670 --> 50:07.900
When do you plan on giving us our money?

50:08.350 --> 50:11.860
Just a little longer. Please just wait a little bit longer.

50:11.860 --> 50:14.310
You've been saying that for days!

50:14.310 --> 50:16.030
I <i>promise</i> I'll bring it tomorrow, okay?

50:16.030 --> 50:19.110
If you don't bring it, you can join Itou in the broken arm club!

50:19.830 --> 50:23.030
Shiratori sure looked scary when he gave the word.

50:23.030 --> 50:25.790
You'd better watch your step.

50:31.270 --> 50:33.870
I wondered why he didn't show up today.

50:33.870 --> 50:36.140
That pinhead!

50:36.140 --> 50:38.110
That bastard Mitsuhashi.

50:38.110 --> 50:39.980
I don't think he intends to pay us.

50:39.980 --> 50:41.940
If that's the case, we'll just beat him up again.

50:42.270 --> 50:43.910
What's up—

50:47.910 --> 50:50.670
Oh, you're all by yourself?

50:50.670 --> 50:53.350
Yeah, our absence rate has been pretty high lately.

50:53.350 --> 50:55.350
That's true...

51:03.750 --> 51:05.040
All right.

51:05.550 --> 51:07.030
There's gotta be at least ¥20,000 here.

51:07.870 --> 51:09.670
Lady Luck was on my side tonight.

51:18.590 --> 51:19.390
Who's there?

51:23.190 --> 51:24.310
Well, hello there.

51:24.990 --> 51:26.750
Oh, it's just you, Mitsuhashi.

51:26.750 --> 51:28.310
What're you doing out here?

51:30.070 --> 51:32.280
I was waiting for you.

51:32.280 --> 51:33.490
What?

51:37.790 --> 51:39.230
Y-You...

51:40.430 --> 51:41.950
You bastards...

51:42.430 --> 51:45.420
I heard you broke Itou's arm.

51:45.420 --> 51:47.150
I-It wasn't me!

51:47.870 --> 51:49.090
That's something I cannot forgive.

51:49.090 --> 51:51.050
W-Wait a sec, Mitsuhashi.

51:51.430 --> 51:53.750
I can't wait any longer!

51:53.750 --> 51:55.060
You deadbeat!

52:15.230 --> 52:17.030
Wh-What?

52:19.870 --> 52:21.710
Everyone's in the hospital?

52:21.710 --> 52:22.830
What's the meaning of this?

52:24.270 --> 52:25.910
Who the hell...

52:28.380 --> 52:29.170
It can't be Itou...

52:29.590 --> 52:30.630
But I'm the only one left?

52:31.390 --> 52:32.460
Dammit!

52:36.390 --> 52:37.830
I-It was you!

52:38.910 --> 52:40.110
Mitsuhashi!

52:40.110 --> 52:43.550
About time. I was getting tired of waiting.

52:44.270 --> 52:45.100
I see.

52:45.100 --> 52:46.510
So you're behind all this.

52:46.510 --> 52:50.480
Taking care of three people last night really wore me out.

52:50.480 --> 52:53.860
The days have been long and arduous.

52:53.860 --> 52:56.240
And this wig was expensive!

52:56.240 --> 53:01.150
I used up all the money I've been stealing from my mom!

53:01.150 --> 53:03.410
And now... now...

53:03.410 --> 53:06.190
Give me back my youth, dammit!

53:07.230 --> 53:09.580
Is that all you have to say, Mitsuhashi?

53:09.950 --> 53:14.050
Because I'm about to put an end to your youth!

53:14.910 --> 53:16.230
Very well.

53:16.230 --> 53:18.510
Let's take this outside and see what you can do.

53:19.190 --> 53:20.390
Oh, how interesting.

53:20.390 --> 53:22.390
You're challenging me to a duel?

53:22.390 --> 53:24.230
Don't underestimate me.

53:24.230 --> 53:25.110
Okay.

53:25.110 --> 53:26.430
Follow me.

53:33.070 --> 53:35.530
B-Bastard! That was a cheap shot!

53:35.910 --> 53:36.910
What?

53:36.910 --> 53:38.150
I can't hear you!

53:39.870 --> 53:40.870
You fucker...

53:40.870 --> 53:42.310
Come on. Stand up!

53:42.310 --> 53:43.950
That one was for Itou.

53:43.950 --> 53:46.910
Now we'll finally get to fight one-on-one.

53:48.390 --> 53:51.880
I didn't become boss of this gang just 'cause I got numbers on my side!

54:03.070 --> 54:05.350
Ninja Technique: The Ephemeral Man.

54:06.470 --> 54:09.070
Just how dastardly can one person be?!

54:10.310 --> 54:13.560
Now I'll teach you one of my favorite sayings:

54:13.560 --> 54:15.510
"Anything goes!"

54:16.230 --> 54:20.200
And not forgetting: "The end justifies the means!"

54:28.070 --> 54:30.190
Ouch...

54:30.190 --> 54:31.190
Jeez...

54:32.080 --> 54:35.030
I must be the stupidest guy on the planet.

54:39.510 --> 54:40.790
Shiratori!

54:40.790 --> 54:41.970
Huh?

54:47.430 --> 54:48.950
Wh-What happened here?

54:53.270 --> 54:54.070
Itou!

54:54.070 --> 54:55.470
You came at a good time!

54:55.470 --> 54:56.390
Want a drink?

54:57.070 --> 54:58.270
Mitsuhashi!

54:58.270 --> 55:00.710
Oh, you're blond again!

55:00.710 --> 55:02.360
What the hell's going on here?

55:02.750 --> 55:05.350
Man, you're slow on the uptake, aren't you?

55:05.350 --> 55:07.070
I taught him a lesson.

55:07.070 --> 55:09.330
I even left some of his face untouched so you could have a turn.

55:09.710 --> 55:10.910
Really?

55:14.630 --> 55:16.590
There's nowhere left to hit...

55:16.590 --> 55:18.470
Look closer, you dope.

55:19.630 --> 55:20.310
Look!

55:22.190 --> 55:23.110
See?

55:23.110 --> 55:26.550
I-I can't bring myself to do it.

55:27.190 --> 55:29.640
After I went through all that trouble to save a spot for you...

55:30.030 --> 55:32.390
More importantly, what about the others?

55:32.390 --> 55:33.850
What the hell did you do?

55:34.750 --> 55:36.310
Isn't it obvious?

55:36.310 --> 55:38.630
While you take them on, I act all obedient.

55:38.630 --> 55:41.830
If they're all over you, they're ignoring me.

55:42.910 --> 55:47.070
They beat you up while I pick them off one at a time.

55:47.070 --> 55:49.110
The perfect plan!

55:50.350 --> 55:51.630
Hold up a second!

55:51.630 --> 55:52.960
Let me get this straight.

55:52.960 --> 55:55.830
I was just a pawn in your plan?

55:55.830 --> 55:58.290
Bingo! We have a winner.

55:58.290 --> 56:01.750
You are, without doubt, completely and utterly <i>heartless.</i>

56:01.750 --> 56:04.070
Yeah, but you've got me beat when it comes to being hardheaded.

56:04.070 --> 56:07.790
Obviously, I'm nothing like you, urine-top.

56:07.790 --> 56:09.790
You wanna go, urchin-head?!

56:09.790 --> 56:11.510
What'd you say? You want some?

56:11.510 --> 56:15.310
Sure. When your arm's better.

56:17.070 --> 56:20.430
I also don't wanna see you lose those golden locks.

56:34.990 --> 56:36.750
So that's what happened?

56:36.750 --> 56:39.110
Yeah, I sure got played.

56:40.090 --> 56:42.430
Yo, let's drop in here real quick.

56:42.430 --> 56:43.190
Okay.

56:54.830 --> 56:56.910
I've... I've finally found you.

56:56.910 --> 56:58.470
Thank you, God!

57:01.390 --> 57:05.270
You've got guts coming onto my patch, Mitsuhashi!

57:09.350 --> 57:11.390
And who might you be?

57:11.390 --> 57:12.630
You prick!

57:12.630 --> 57:16.070
How dare you say that to Imai of Beni High?!

57:16.070 --> 57:19.950
Right back at ya, treating a customer like this...

57:19.950 --> 57:21.000
Who are you trying to kid?

57:21.000 --> 57:24.150
To me, you'll never be a custom—

57:27.670 --> 57:29.710
Forgive my rudeness.

57:29.710 --> 57:32.470
Now, what can I help you with today?

57:32.470 --> 57:35.030
Looking for anything in particular?

57:36.110 --> 57:38.980
Nope, I don't need anything from here, shit-for-brains.

57:38.980 --> 57:41.710
Man, they're so <i>rude</i> in this store.

57:45.910 --> 57:48.270
Imai, as of next week, I'm cutting your pay.

57:50.910 --> 57:52.430
And after...

57:52.430 --> 57:55.070
And after I finally found him!

57:56.070 --> 57:56.990
Hey.

57:57.870 --> 57:58.830
Hey!

57:59.870 --> 58:01.920
Gimme a sec, big mouth!

58:03.750 --> 58:05.710
What did you say?

58:05.710 --> 58:07.350
Are you saying you won't serve me?!

58:07.350 --> 58:08.170
Hey!

58:08.510 --> 58:11.150
N-No, you got it wro—

58:18.190 --> 58:22.870
Mitsuhashi really is...
what's the word.... smart.

58:22.870 --> 58:24.590
He's just a rat bastard.

58:24.590 --> 58:25.550
What did you say?

58:25.550 --> 58:26.510
Am I wrong?

58:26.510 --> 58:28.190
Of course you are!

58:28.190 --> 58:28.990
Then, what are you?

58:28.990 --> 58:33.310
Well, in a few words: a big shot!

58:35.270 --> 58:38.510
Yeah, some big shot you are.

58:41.940 --> 58:47.920
Presented by Saizen-Yabai

58:41.940 --> 58:47.920
Starting  today,  I'll!!

58:49.790 --> 58:51.990
Let's worry about the future tomorrow.

58:51.990 --> 58:54.640
When tomorrow comes, it'll all work out.

58:57.990 --> 58:59.950
If it doesn't work out, I'll just run away.

58:59.950 --> 59:03.070
If I'm found, I'll make up an excuse.

59:05.950 --> 59:07.950
You and me are friends, partner.

59:07.950 --> 59:09.690
If the going gets tough, the tough say goodbye.

59:09.950 --> 59:12.030
You and me are friends, partner.

59:13.950 --> 59:16.030
I help you.

59:14.870 --> 59:16.030
We're family.

59:16.030 --> 59:17.790
I like you.

59:29.910 --> 59:31.950
On stressful days, I'll hit you.

59:31.950 --> 59:34.180
Then, I'll say, "I'm sorry," and you'll forgive me.

59:37.790 --> 59:39.350
That cute girl is mine,

59:39.350 --> 59:42.440
but I belong to no one.

59:49.950 --> 59:51.990
We are all brothers and sisters in this world.

59:51.990 --> 59:53.910
Even the going gets tough, the tough kick and scream.

01:00:21.810 --> 01:00:23.770
You and me are friends, partner.

01:00:23.770 --> 01:00:25.830
If the going gets tough, the tough say goodbye.

01:00:37.830 --> 01:00:39.830
I Help You

01:00:38.710 --> 01:00:39.830
We are a family.

01:00:39.830 --> 01:00:42.950
I Like You

01:00:43.250 --> 01:00:49.880
See Ya!
